   "text": "4. VALIDATOR (same rules for\nevery channel)\n• text not empty, not too long\n• timestamp parseable\n• customer_id valid\n• bad rows → row errors (shown\n   in UI), good rows kept\nfiles: ingestion/base.py ·\nvalidator.py",
