   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "5. IDENTITY RESOLUTION: who is the\ncustomer?\n1) explicit customer ID in the data\n2) directory match: email\n(lower-case), phone (last 10 digits),\nhandle (no @), compared as salted\nHMAC-SHA256 hashes\n3) unknown sender → pseudonymous ID\n(EMAIL-…, PHONE-…, SOCIAL-…)\n4) otherwise anonymous (never merged\nlater)\nfile: ingestion/identity.py",
   "originalText": "5. IDENTITY RESOLUTION: who is the\ncustomer?\n1) explicit customer ID in the data\n2) directory match: email\n(lower-case), phone (last 10 digits),\nhandle (no @), compared as salted\nHMAC-SHA256 hashes\n3) unknown sender → pseudonymous ID\n(EMAIL-…, PHONE-…, SOCIAL-…)\n4) otherwise anonymous (never merged\nlater)\nfile: ingestion/identity.py",
