   "text": "CUSTOMER DIRECTORY CSV (CRM export)\ncustomer_id, email, phone, social_handle +\ncountry, state, age_group, student_status,\nincome_bracket\n• contacts stored ONLY as salted hashes,\n   names never stored\n• demographics go on the customer record\n   (used by segments + filters)\n• uploaded after complaints? earlier\n   pseudonymous complaints are moved to the\n   real customer and dedup + scoring re-run\nfile: ingestion/directory.py",
