   "updated": 1763000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "STAGE 1 · PREPROCESS\nclean_text() for every complaint:\n• Unicode, HTML, quoted replies, \"Sent\n   from my iPhone\" removed\n• NOT lower-cased; negations kept (\"not\n   delivered\")\n• order IDs extracted first: \"order\n   number 396765\" → ORD-396765\n• PII masked: emails → [EMAIL], phones →\n   [PHONE], cards → [CARD], SSN → [SSN]\n→ saved as normalized_text\nfiles: preprocessing/cleaner.py ·\npii_detection.py",
   "originalText": "STAGE 1 · PREPROCESS\nclean_text() for every complaint:\n• Unicode, HTML, quoted replies, \"Sent\n   from my iPhone\" removed\n• NOT lower-cased; negations kept (\"not\n   delivered\")\n• order IDs extracted first: \"order\n   number 396765\" → ORD-396765\n• PII masked: emails → [EMAIL], phones →\n   [PHONE], cards → [CARD], SSN → [SSN]\n→ saved as normalized_text\nfiles: preprocessing/cleaner.py ·\npii_detection.py",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
