   "text": "STAGE 2 · EMBED\nall-MiniLM-L6-v2 runs LOCALLY (no API)\nmasked text → 384-number meaning vector\nsimilar meaning = close vectors, even\nwith no shared words\nstored in ChromaDB (cosine);\nalready-embedded complaints skipped\nfiles: inference/embeddings.py ·\nvector_store.py",
