   "text": "STAGE 3 · CLASSIFY  (GPT-4o-mini)\nper complaint: category (1 of 11),\nseverity (CRITICAL/HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW),\nsummary, entities, evidence quote\n1) cache hit? → no call\n2) batches of 10, 6 in parallel (first\nbatch alone as a probe)\n3) JSON schema enforced + validated\n4) API fails → keyword rules, marked\n'fallback'\nfile: inference/classifier.py",
   "originalText": "STAGE 3 · CLASSIFY  (GPT-4o-mini)\nper complaint: category (1 of 11),\nseverity (CRITICAL/HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW),\nsummary, entities, evidence quote\n1) cache hit? → no call\n2) batches of 10, 6 in parallel (first\nbatch alone as a probe)\n3) JSON schema enforced + validated\n4) API fails → keyword rules, marked\n'fallback'\nfile: inference/classifier.py",
