   "updated": 1763000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "STAGE 4 · CLUSTER → ISSUES\n< 80 complaints: one issue per category\n(≥ 2 complaints)\n≥ 80: HDBSCAN (min size 8) finds dense\ngroups; outliers stay unclustered\nconsolidate clusters with centroid\ncosine ≥ 0.5\nstable IDs: match previous issues\n(overlap ≥ 50% or cosine ≥ 0.8);\nvanished → STALE\nfile: inference/clustering.py",
   "originalText": "STAGE 4 · CLUSTER → ISSUES\n< 80 complaints: one issue per category\n(≥ 2 complaints)\n≥ 80: HDBSCAN (min size 8) finds dense\ngroups; outliers stay unclustered\nconsolidate clusters with centroid\ncosine ≥ 0.5\nstable IDs: match previous issues\n(overlap ≥ 50% or cosine ≥ 0.8);\nvanished → STALE\nfile: inference/clustering.py",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "s4",
