   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "STAGE 5 · LABEL ISSUES  (GPT-4o-mini)\nper issue: 5 most typical complaints +\nkeywords →\ntitle, description, category, symptoms\n(facts), root-cause hypotheses\n(speculative)\ninvented complaint IDs dropped\nre-labelled only if its representatives\nchange; analyst edits never overwritten\nno GPT → title = category + TF-IDF\nkeywords",
   "originalText": "STAGE 5 · LABEL ISSUES  (GPT-4o-mini)\nper issue: 5 most typical complaints +\nkeywords →\ntitle, description, category, symptoms\n(facts), root-cause hypotheses\n(speculative)\ninvented complaint IDs dropped\nre-labelled only if its representatives\nchange; analyst edits never overwritten\nno GPT → title = category + TF-IDF\nkeywords",
