   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "STAGE 6 · DEDUPLICATE → INCIDENTS\nonly within ONE verified customer:\nT1 shared order/txn ID → merge (0.95)\ndifferent order IDs → never merge\nT2 ≤ 7 days + cosine ≥ 0.55 + same\nissue/category → merge (0.75–0.90)\nT3 partial evidence → new incident +\nreview queue\ntext similarity alone never merges\nfile: deduplication/incident_matching.py",
   "originalText": "STAGE 6 · DEDUPLICATE → INCIDENTS\nonly within ONE verified customer:\nT1 shared order/txn ID → merge (0.95)\ndifferent order IDs → never merge\nT2 ≤ 7 days + cosine ≥ 0.55 + same\nissue/category → merge (0.75–0.90)\nT3 partial evidence → new incident +\nreview queue\ntext similarity alone never merges\nfile: deduplication/incident_matching.py",
