   "text": "STAGE 7 · SCORE\nP = 0.35 Impact + 0.25 Severity + 0.20\nRecurrence + 0.10 Growth + 0.10 Business\nImpact uses UNIQUE CUSTOMERS (log scale)\nissue severity computed from its\ncomplaints (never by GPT)\nstores full breakdown + template\nexplanation per issue\nfiles: analytics/prioritization.py ·\nseverity.py",
