   "updated": 1763000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "THE GPT GATE: what leaves the machine\nSENT: masked normalized_text (batches of 10) · for labels: ~5 masked sample texts +\nkeywords + issue size + random internal complaint IDs\nNEVER SENT: customer IDs · names from records · contact details · demographics · original\ntext · audio (Whisper is local) · any counts or scores\nNOT MASKED (be honest): names written inside the text, e.g. \"Thanks, Vik\"\nThe one call site: classifier.py:188  client.chat.completions.parse(model=gpt-4o-mini,\ntemperature=0, response_format=<Pydantic schema>)\nNo key or LLM_ENABLED=false → no client is created, nothing is sent",
   "originalText": "THE GPT GATE: what leaves the machine\nSENT: masked normalized_text (batches of 10) · for labels: ~5 masked sample texts +\nkeywords + issue size + random internal complaint IDs\nNEVER SENT: customer IDs · names from records · contact details · demographics · original\ntext · audio (Whisper is local) · any counts or scores\nNOT MASKED (be honest): names written inside the text, e.g. \"Thanks, Vik\"\nThe one call site: classifier.py:188  client.chat.completions.parse(model=gpt-4o-mini,\ntemperature=0, response_format=<Pydantic schema>)\nNo key or LLM_ENABLED=false → no client is created, nothing is sent",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "gate",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
