   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "HOW THE PIPELINE RUNS\nservices/pipeline.py · process_batch()\n• one run at a time (process-wide lock)\n• progress written to the batch row → Upload page progress bar\n• stages 3–7 run over ALL complaints, so new data can re-shape issues\n• any error → batch FAILED with message; Retry button re-runs it (cached GPT answers\n   reused)\n• server stopped mid-run → marked FAILED on next start",
   "originalText": "HOW THE PIPELINE RUNS\nservices/pipeline.py · process_batch()\n• one run at a time (process-wide lock)\n• progress written to the batch row → Upload page progress bar\n• stages 3–7 run over ALL complaints, so new data can re-shape issues\n• any error → batch FAILED with message; Retry button re-runs it (cached GPT answers\n   reused)\n• server stopped mid-run → marked FAILED on next start",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "pipenote",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
