   "text": "LLM CACHE: backend/cache/llm_cache.db\nevery GPT answer, keyed by sha256(task | model |\ntext)\nkept OUTSIDE storage/, so a reset keeps it:\nre-uploading the same files makes ~0 calls (~23 s\nfor the full CSV)\nnot used when the LLM is disabled\nfile: inference/llm_cache.py",
   "originalText": "LLM CACHE: backend/cache/llm_cache.db\nevery GPT answer, keyed by sha256(task | model |\ntext)\nkept OUTSIDE storage/, so a reset keeps it:\nre-uploading the same files makes ~0 calls (~23 s\nfor the full CSV)\nnot used when the LLM is disabled\nfile: inference/llm_cache.py",
