   "updated": 1763000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "ANALYTICS SERVICE\n• builds one analytics table from SQLite (complaint +\n   customer + issue + incident)\n• filters (country, state, age, student, income,\n   channel, dates, severity) → scores RECOMPUTED on the\n   filtered subset with the same formula\n• segments: unique customers per value; < 3 customers\n   hidden (privacy); rates only if populations uploaded\n• emerging issues: last 3 days vs 14-day baseline, z ≥\n   2 and ≥ 3 incidents\nfiles: services/analytics_service.py ·\nanalytics/segmentation.py · trends.py",
   "originalText": "ANALYTICS SERVICE\n• builds one analytics table from SQLite (complaint +\n   customer + issue + incident)\n• filters (country, state, age, student, income,\n   channel, dates, severity) → scores RECOMPUTED on the\n   filtered subset with the same formula\n• segments: unique customers per value; < 3 customers\n   hidden (privacy); rates only if populations uploaded\n• emerging issues: last 3 days vs 14-day baseline, z ≥\n   2 and ≥ 3 incidents\nfiles: services/analytics_service.py ·\nanalytics/segmentation.py · trends.py",
