   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "n-why-t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 3124,
   "y": 932.5,
   "width": 525.2800000000001,
   "height": 192.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1049193573,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1587106771,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1763000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "WHY GPT AND NOT JUST KEYWORDS / DICTIONARIES?\nDictionaries turn a LABEL into a NUMBER (CRITICAL → 100). Something\nmust first READ the text to decide the label: that is GPT's job.\nMeasured on the 616 CSV complaints vs the answer key:\nkeyword matching: severity macro-F1 0.34, catches 16% of CRITICAL,\n32% of HIGH\nGPT-4o-mini: macro-F1 0.51, catches 45% of CRITICAL, 94% of HIGH\n(but over-calls MEDIUM as HIGH)\nKeywords miss paraphrase: \"considering legal action\", \"money is\ngone from my account\"\nRule: AI reads the language, deterministic code does every number",
   "originalText": "WHY GPT AND NOT JUST KEYWORDS / DICTIONARIES?\nDictionaries turn a LABEL into a NUMBER (CRITICAL → 100). Something\nmust first READ the text to decide the label: that is GPT's job.\nMeasured on the 616 CSV complaints vs the answer key:\nkeyword matching: severity macro-F1 0.34, catches 16% of CRITICAL,\n32% of HIGH\nGPT-4o-mini: macro-F1 0.51, catches 45% of CRITICAL, 94% of HIGH\n(but over-calls MEDIUM as HIGH)\nKeywords miss paraphrase: \"considering legal action\", \"money is\ngone from my account\"\nRule: AI reads the language, deterministic code does every number",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "n-why",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
