   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "MEASURED RESULTS (scripts/evaluate.py, synthetic data)\nsimilar-complaint precision@10 0.958\nclusters 18 for 10 true families · ARI 0.684 · NMI 0.827\ndedup precision 0.986 · recall 0.423 · 0 incidents span 2 customers\nranking NDCG@10 0.829\ncross-channel re-reports merged 22/22 · new complaints wrongly\nmerged 0/39\nidentity links 100% · voice order numbers recovered 4/4",
   "originalText": "MEASURED RESULTS (scripts/evaluate.py, synthetic data)\nsimilar-complaint precision@10 0.958\nclusters 18 for 10 true families · ARI 0.684 · NMI 0.827\ndedup precision 0.986 · recall 0.423 · 0 incidents span 2 customers\nranking NDCG@10 0.829\ncross-channel re-reports merged 22/22 · new complaints wrongly\nmerged 0/39\nidentity links 100% · voice order numbers recovered 4/4",
